I ran `git blame` at HEAD on the non-vendored files (`attribute.go`, `attribute_string.go`, `color.go`, `color_windows.go`, `doc.go`, the test file and similar), using `.git-blame-ignore-revs` to skip the `any` reformat commit. That covers 1,915 lines, and I left out `vendor/`, `go.sum` and `LICENSE.md`.

