- **Method:** `git blame` with `-w -M -C` on every tracked `.go` file outside `vendor/`. That is 6 files: `attribute.go`, `attribute_string.go`, `color.go`, `color_test.go`, `color_windows.go` and `doc.go`. I used `.git-blame-ignore-revs`, which skips the `interface{}` to `any` rewrite.
