**Verdict:** one person wrote just over half the code, but ownership is not concentrated to the point of a one-person project. The #1 share is large and the #2 share is small, so Fatih's departure would remove the main knowledge holder. I did not check whether Fatih still commits. The latest history shows Raj Patel doing the maintenance.

